ast time. </content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1202267393693149470/comments/default/8803352975311349888'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1202267393693149470/comments/default/8803352975311349888'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/10/the-drug-war.html?showComment=1484914080938#c8803352975311349888' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/10/the-drug-war.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1202267393693149470' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/1202267393693149470' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1306904184"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 20, 2017 at 5:08 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1296891580076871432</id><published>2014-10-07T07:09:39.404-06:00</published><updated>2014-10-07T07:09:39.404-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This will only stop when the cops and doctors invo...</title><content type='html'>This will only stop when the cops and doctors involved pay a high price for each such violation.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1202267393693149470/comments/default/1296891580076871432'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/1202267393693149470/comments/default/1296891580076871432'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2014/10/the-drug-war.html?showComment=1412687379404#c1296891580076871432' title=''/><author